  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 3 × 2 + 8 - 18 = 21\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the two numbers (not digits) and two signs :\n\nOption 1) 3, 18 and +, ×\n\n24 ÷ 3 × 2 + 8 - 18 = 21 ⇒ 24 ÷ 18 + 2 × 8 - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 18**__ + 2 × 8 - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ 1.33 + __**2 ×**____** 8**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**1.33 + 16**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __17.33 ____**- 3**__ = 21\n\n14.33 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 8, 24 and +, ÷\n\n24 ÷ 3 × 2 + 8 - 18 = 21 ⇒ 8 + 3 × 2 ÷ 24 - 18 = 21\n\n ⇒ 8 + 3 × __**2 **____**÷**____** 24**__ - 18 = 21\n\n ⇒ 8 + __**3 × 0.08**__ - 18 = 21\n\n ⇒ __**8 + 0.24**__ - 18 = 21\n\n ⇒ __**8.**____**24 - 18**__ = 21\n\n-9.76 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 3, 2 and -, ×\n\n24 ÷ 3 × 2 + 8 - 18 = 21 ⇒ 24 ÷ 2 - 3 + 8 × 18 = 21\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 2**__ - 3 + 8 × 18 = 21\n\n⇒ 12 - 3 + __**8 **____**×**____** 18**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**12 + 144**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**156 - 3**__ = 21\n\n153 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 3, 8 and -, +\n\n24 ÷ 3 × 2 + 8 - 18 = 21 ⇒ 24 ÷ 8 × 2 - 3 + 18 = 21\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 8**__ × 2 - 3 + 18 = 21\n\n⇒ __**3 × 2**__ - 3 + 18 = 21\n\n⇒ __**6 + 18**__ - 3 = 21\n\n⇒ __**24 - 3**__ = 21\n\n**21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
